    {
      "id": "s_story",
      "type": "story",
      "preset": "Full",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full",
        "heading": "",
        "image": "as_4x5_lake",
        "image_alt": "Alder, the first cabin",
        "caption": "Alder",
        "caption_meta": "2009",
        "color_scheme": "paper",
        "body": "<p>Alder went up first, a single cabin on the east shore with a woodstove, two bunks and a rowboat tied to the dock. We built most of it by hand over one long summer, and the first guests were friends who didn't mind the outhouse.</p><p>Birch and Cedar followed, then the farmhouse, where we still live upstairs. We keep it small on purpose: five cabins, a sauna on the water and the same rowboat, repainted most springs. Most of what we know about the lake, we learned from the people who stay.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s_story_b1",
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "year": "2009",
            "title": "One cabin",
            "text": "Alder went up in a summer, mostly by hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s_story_b2",
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "year": "2013",
            "title": "Birch and Cedar",
            "text": "Two more cabins and the first season we sold out.",
            "image": "as_3x2_forest",
            "image_alt": "Birch and Cedar from the dock"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s_story_b3",
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "year": "2017",
            "title": "The farmhouse",
            "text": "We moved in upstairs and opened two rooms."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s_story_b4",
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "year": "2021",
            "title": "The bunkhouse",
            "text": "For the paddling groups who kept asking.",
            "image": "as_3x2_sand",
            "image_alt": "The bunkhouse porch"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s_story_b5",
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "year": "2026",
            "title": "Today",
            "text": "Five cabins, a sauna, and the same rowboat."
          }
        }
      ]
